\begin_layout Section
The Missing Source
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The paper states that “the mathematical models of calculating the inception voltage, the length and the charge quantity of positive corona streamer were established” in its reference [9]:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Quote
W. D. Wang and H. T. Wang, “Model research on the effects of space charge in gas discharge”, High Voltage Engineering, 1986, pp. 59–64 (in Chinese).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
If a copy can be obtained (university library, interlibrary loan, or the journal's archive), even a machine translation of its equations would replace most of the candidate models above with the authors' actual ones. Until then, the reconstruction proceeds with the documented assumptions.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
How the Reconstruction Will Be Judged
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Because the inputs are partly assumed, an exact match with Figures 6 to 8 is neither expected nor a meaningful target. The reconstruction is successful if it reproduces:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
the 
\series bold
