\series default
: the second streamer needs a higher voltage than the first, and the two curves converge for slow fronts;
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
the 
\series bold
magnitudes
\series default
: values within the range of the paper's curves (for example 
\begin_inset Formula $V_{cs}$
\end_inset
 of about 
